@Sushi
started really low.  I started at .5 and had to stop and start a few times.
After 6 months I never benefited but many here have.
Type LDN in the search bar and you'll  find lots of convos about it.

@daisybell
I stopped my 2nd 4.5 ldn dose in pm on July 10th because I had so much hair falling out!! I am now only taking 4.5.
But, now I am relapsing? Pain increasing, exhaustion, migraine /nausea, weakness, fast heart beat, pots?, trouble breathing from exertion. I don't know if it related to lessening ldn or just a fluke that I'm relapsing again! Scary and disappointing! I love my ldn!

